  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "311975f0010598a8c0bd25c9ab2938fafb39cf8bbbc784f50f30108bb24327e0",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5b02345582a2b6a55c31feaa460a20ba6c68a704b0efd8bf8cfa38bf8cf6f7a4",
      "text": "悟空的\n摇摇晃晃\n自行车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d3205a3535fd25a12f46ccecd11145dccaff6f66e1699c186bd30a3bd79eb211",
      "text": "“看，他们骑得多棒！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！\n“我也想骑！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ecee2f25b3fbfe1504f34e8e823ba977ece2f0a4c2c0b6455808f53328cbe499",
      "text": "悟空戴上头盔。\n“准备好啦！”\n“嗯……戴反了！”\n悟空咯咯笑。\n“再试一次！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cdf46abb29a61628940550c29bfcc46a775f2f0dfcfd1ed8bb938c451fa0bab5",
      "text": "他用脚蹬地。\n嗖，嗖，嗖。\n“看！小猴滑板车！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08bac4da5bc34e29c28bb3226c0ea400e879c327f0a8083f7a0084ff4489db83",
      "text": "脚抬起来……\n摇呀！晃呀！\n扑通！\n“你好呀，小草。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98d949fd1a1cda0c23da9719f2b3d1ca47deffdc8e054c8d87828c2ebaab7dfb",
      "text": "“按按铃，也许就不晃啦。”\n叮铃！叮铃！\n铃铛倒是响了，\n车子还是晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a7118b996e9d053e373db596797089f230211b6d0993e93b3b368aec8fc26917",
      "text": "八戒扶住车座。\n“眼睛看前面，慢慢来。”\n玉兔在旁边喊：\n“你能行！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "683c0aac81f65f3d85eef47c29f791ec03a1e6ab612631e0978dc1b8c902e47d",
      "text": "悟空又试了一次。\n蹬地，出发！\n踩一下脚踏板，\n再踩一下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a71db300cf16be9d39ad35126451035bf0a0f9ea97a97e9c54ce93f2c8e68887",
      "text": "他往左边晃，\n尾巴往右边晃。\n“我的尾巴也在学呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1bbc194f7f2ec82c2a992a7d85439010d3a0e5b5dff9b2a15552c432d9d82ad5",
      "text": "他每天都练一会儿。\n有时只能骑一小段，\n有时还是晃呀晃。\n他每天都再试一试。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02cbaa234af9588dfc259d70fbfdb8401abe78d952152aa58c730bdc99577e38",
      "text": "有一天傍晚……\n八戒松开了手。\n悟空还在往前骑！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34620b7a045fe49bcd500323b998e2a2c601b40f1b9a57439b405e9f4de95ca8",
      "text": "“我会骑啦！”\n他的围巾飘呀飘，\n尾巴绕了个圈。\n连耳朵都觉得好骄傲。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "64c925dd9162f87c14f81ad5b0fcab1632f851d970ad1f25c14b92ee667add3c",
      "text": "他学会了转弯，\n也学会了停车——\n就停在水坑前。\n“小鸭子，你先走。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2959f18627e5fc2e4c75d35b782d791e318757eefc50f0234d353d2de2235d74",
      "text": "现在，他们一起骑车。\n不着急，\n轮子开开心心地转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "40cedaade250bb0a403eb40753c659b4af8f1ebbaa4b9c4de4e69049021d2b5f",
      "text": "回到家，他停好自行车。\n“晚安，轮子。”\n“晚安，摇摇晃晃。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a5fb66599acd158454cded2cd7402a9cf67f77c9eaf5409799b9c347a535640",
      "text": "悟空在床上蜷成一团。\n梦里的小路平平整整，\n轮子轻轻地说：\n“嘘……”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
