    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0d32cb481fb1eb58562ded153174f2fe976616a5730ce8ee2a8a5a650b4a2f49",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n摇一摇，晃一晃。\n再试一次，\n出发啦！\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
